		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Je n’abandonne jamais.\nToi non plus d’ailleurs?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00249" index="249">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">... C’est fini.\rJe me sens... bizarre...\rJe ne suis pas fâché mais... plutôt\nheureux. Heureux d’être le témoin de la\fnaissance d’un nouveau Maître!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00250" index="250">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huhuhu... Vas-y, aie confiance...\nEt ton imprudence te coûtera le match!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00251" index="251">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">C’est moi qui ai été imprudent?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00252" index="252">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tu es la personne la plus\nimpressionnante de tout Johto.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00253" index="253">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hahaha! Ça chatouille, ça chatouille!!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00254" index="254">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aïe aïe aïe aïe!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00255" index="255">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">T’es vachement balèze, toi!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00256" index="256">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hum, tu te défends bien.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00257" index="257">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tu n’es pas seulement là pour gâcher\nl’ambiance.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00258" index="258">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah, déjà fini...?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00259" index="259">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">C’est now que ça starte vraiment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00260" index="260">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh noes, c’est le last!\nMais never je n’abandonnerai.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00261" index="261">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mes tricks électriques sont\nà plat...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00262" index="262">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ne retiens pas tes coups!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00263" index="263">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Voilà une situation délicate...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00264" index="264">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Je n’aurais pas dû te sous-estimer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00265" index="265">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mais tu te bats plutôt bien, dis-moi!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00266" index="266">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ça se présente mal...\nNon, ça VA mal.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00267" index="267">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...!!\nQuelle force!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00268" index="268">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hi, hi, hi! Je sais comment ça va se\nfinir...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00269" index="269">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ce n’est pas le futur que j’avais vu...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00270" index="270">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmmmm... Evidemment...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00271" index="271">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Notre détermination est sans faille!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00272" index="272">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nous continuerons, sans faillir.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0728_00273" index="273">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mais ma détermination n’est toujours\npas entamée!</language>
